---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'October 2, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — ToolsSite"
  description="Read the ToolsSite terms of service for using our free online tools."
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <section class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Welcome to ToolsSite. By accessing or using our website, you agree to be bound by
        these Terms of Service. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please do
        not use our website.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">1. Use of Our Tools</h2>
      <p>
        Our tools are provided free of charge for personal and commercial use. You may use
        them as often as you like, subject to these terms. You agree not to:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li>Use the website for any unlawful purpose</li>
        <li>Attempt to disrupt or overload our servers</li>
        <li>Copy, resell, or redistribute our tools without permission</li>
        <li>Use automated scripts to abuse the service</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">2. No Warranty</h2>
      <p>
        Our tools are provided "as is" and "as available" without any warranties of any
        kind, express or implied. We do not guarantee that the tools will be error-free,
        uninterrupted, or produce accurate results in every situation.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">3. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        ToolsSite shall not be liable for any damages arising from the use or inability to
        use our website or tools, including but not limited to data loss, loss of profits,
        or business interruption.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        All content on ToolsSite — including the design, code, text, and graphics — is the
        property of ToolsSite unless otherwise stated. You may not reproduce, distribute,
        or create derivative works without our written permission.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">5. User Content</h2>
      <p>
        You are solely responsible for any content you process using our tools. Since all
        processing happens in your browser, we never see or store your content.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">6. Third-Party Links and Ads</h2>
      <p>
        Our website may contain links to third-party websites and display third-party
        advertisements. We are not responsible for the content, privacy practices, or
        accuracy of any third-party site.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">7. Changes to These Terms</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these Terms of Service at any time. Changes will be posted on this
        page with an updated "Last updated" date. Continued use of the website after
        changes means you accept the new terms.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">8. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For questions about these Terms, visit our{' '}
        <a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>